 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "You're on the motorway. Suddenly, everyone stops. For no reason.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "Then you see why. A penguin parade. Two hundred of them, crossing the motorway. Very, very slowly. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers honk, and try to squeeze through.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. Two hundred penguins dive. Belly first. Straight under your car.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Now your car is a sledge. They slide you off the motorway, down to the sea, and onto an iceberg. Bye bye!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Hazard lights on. Engine off. And wait.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "But penguins are slow. So you turn on the radio. Marching music!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "The whole parade waddles to the beat. Twice as fast!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "Only the smallest one can't keep up. So it climbs onto your roof, and uses your car as a slide. Whee!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "And as a thank-you, its dad leaves you a fish. Under the wiper.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: a giant snail at the height barrier. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
